0..78 Comment "// `Path.ap` acts on a path through a suspended function that states its type."
79..81 Comment "//"
82..157 Comment "// The editor answers at every node the checker judges. A function given to"
158..224 Comment "// `Path.ap` holds such nodes, as a function given to a call does."
